{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114088","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114088/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114088/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114088/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114088","id":3736048029,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7er5Gd","number":114088,"title":"Imported meshes render at the wrong scale in 2D","user":{"login":"celyk","id":50609684,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNjA5Njg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50609684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk","html_url":"https://github.com/celyk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-12-16T19:28:03Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T12:21:35Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.5.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - macOS Sequoia (15.3.0) - Single-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M2 (Apple8) - Apple M2 (8 threads) - 8.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen attempting to render a mesh in 2D via MeshInstance2D, the mesh becomes squashed down into the corner. Turning off compression allows the mesh to be rendered at the expected scale and position.\n\nI believe this happens because the canvas shader does not unpack the compressed mesh, so the vertex positions are stuck in the 0-1 range. \n\n<img width=\"808\" height=\"421\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/501c7ece-1210-4bcc-bb98-d121bfe5e9b3\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Import a mesh\n2. Instantiate the imported PackedScene\n3. Set editable children to access the MeshInstance3D\n4. Copy the ArrayMesh into a MeshInstance2D\n5. Zoom in / scale the node to see it\n6. If the mesh is compressed the whole thing will be squashed into the 0-1 range in local space\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[untitled-1765912049.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24198587/untitled-1765912049.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114088/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114088/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}